            0.579,
            0.516
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_518_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "I _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s) = \\pm K I _ {\\mathrm{X}} (s) = \\pm K \\frac {U _ {\\mathrm{X}} (s)}{R _ {1}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
