        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.729,
            0.863,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "电流模式基本单元电路在通信、测量、控制等电流模式电路设计中获得了广泛的应用，特别是在电流模式滤波器设计中具有重要应用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.795,
            0.399,
            0.816
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "§B-2 跨导放大器"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.842,
            0.863,
            0.906
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "这里主要介绍(运算)跨导放大器(operationnal transconductance amplifier, OTA)，其图形符号和它的理想电路模型如图 B-8 所示，它有两个输入端，一个输出端，一个控制端。跨导运算放大器的输入信号为电压信号，图中“+”表示同相输入端，“-”表示反相"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 520,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.595,
            0.056,
            0.741,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "§ B-2 跨导放大器"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.797,
            0.057,
            0.825,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "497"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.107,
            0.825,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "输入端, 输出信号为电流信号, 其开环增益称为跨导, 用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "g_{m}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  表示, 它具有电导的性质, 受控制端的偏置电流  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{B}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  或偏置电压  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U_{B}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  控制。跨导运算放大器的输出电流近似为"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.397,
            0.153,
            0.524,
            0.171
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "i _ {\\mathrm{m}} = g _ {\\mathrm{m}} (  u _ {\\mathrm{P}} - u _ {\\mathrm{N}}  )"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.175,
            0.825,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "对于理想电路模型,由于两个电压输入端开路,故其差模输入阻抗无穷大,而输出电流类似于一个受差模输入电压控制的电流源,因此其输出阻抗为无穷大。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.226,
            0.725,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.209,
                0.226,
                0.725,
                0.37
              ],
              "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_image_5.jpg",
              "content": "(a) 图形符号\n(b) 理想电路模型"
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.386,
                0.378,
                0.542,
                0.393
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 B-8 跨导放大器"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text_image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.41,
            0.827,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "与常规的运算放大器(电压输入/电压输出)相比较,跨导运算放大器特点为:(1)输入差模电压控制输出电流;(2)增加了一个控制端,调节控制电流 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{B}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 可以改变跨导 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "g_{m}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 值;(3)具有电流模式电路的特点。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.477,
            0.827,
            0.539
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "跨导运算放大器的作用是将电压信号变换为电流信号,可对电流模式电路输入信号进行预处理,通常在电压模式与电流模式电路之间作为接口电路使用,其次它可以构成各种基本单元电路用于滤波器设计及各种电子测量、控制、通信电路。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.544,
            0.743,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "以跨导运算放大器构成的差模电压积分器如图 B-9 所示, 其输出电流为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.356,
            0.565,
            0.572,
            0.585
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "I _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s) = g _ {\\mathrm{m}} \\left[ U _ {\\mathrm{P}} (s) - U _ {\\mathrm{N}} (s) \\right]"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.589,
            0.21,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "输出电压为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.351,
            0.612,
            0.579,
            0.647
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "U _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s) = \\frac {1}{s C} I _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s) = \\frac {1}{s C} g _ {\\mathrm{m}} U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.654,
            0.228,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "故传输函数为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.391,
            0.675,
            0.543,
            0.716
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_equation_14.jpg",
          "content": "H (s) = \\frac {U _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s)}{U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s)} = \\frac {g _ {\\mathrm{m}}}{s C}"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.348,
            0.734,
            0.586,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.348,
                0.734,
                0.586,
                0.858
              ],
              "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_520_image_15.jpg",
              "content": "uP\n+\nui\n-\nuN\n+\ngm\n-\nC\n+\nuo\n-"
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.371,
