          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "附录 B 电流传输器和跨导放大器简介"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.105,
            0.867,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "以跨导运算放大器构成的有损电压积分器如图 B-10 所示, 其跨导运算放大器 1 输出电流  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{o1}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.339,
            0.15,
            0.656,
            0.169
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "I _ {\\mathrm{o1}} (s) = g _ {\\mathrm{m1}} \\left[ U _ {\\mathrm{P}} (s) - U _ {\\mathrm{N}} (s) \\right] = g _ {\\mathrm{m1}} U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.171,
            0.636,
            0.191
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "跨导运算放大器 2 的同相输入端接地, 其输出电流  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{o2}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.351,
            0.195,
            0.643,
            0.214
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_equation_6.jpg",
          "content": "I _ {\\mathrm{o2}} (s) = g _ {\\mathrm{m2}} [ 0 - U _ {c} (s) ] = - g _ {\\mathrm{m2}} U _ {c} (s)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.217,
            0.865,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "由于跨导运算放大器 2 输出电流  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{o2}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  反馈到它的反相输入端, 因此电容 C 的电流  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I_{C}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.323,
            0.262,
            0.672,
            0.281
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "I _ {C} (s) = I _ {\\mathrm{o1}} (s) + I _ {\\mathrm{o2}} (s) = g _ {\\mathrm{m1}} U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s) - g _ {\\mathrm{m2}} U _ {C} (s)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.284,
            0.354,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "而电容 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的电压 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U_{c}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.308,
            0.673,
            0.343
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "U _ {c} (s) = \\frac {1}{s C} I _ {c} (s) = \\frac {1}{s C} g _ {\\mathrm{m1}} U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s) - \\frac {1}{s C} g _ {\\mathrm{m2}} U _ {c} (s)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.349,
            0.601,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "由于电压  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "U_{0}(s)=U_{C}(s)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，故有损电压积分器传输函数为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.405,
            0.373,
            0.593,
            0.414
          ],
          "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "H (s) = \\frac {U _ {\\mathrm{o}} (s)}{U _ {\\mathrm{i}} (s)} = \\frac {g _ {\\mathrm{m1}}}{s C + g _ {\\mathrm{m2}}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.422,
            0.741,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.259,
                0.422,
                0.741,
                0.549
              ],
              "image_path": "raw/pages_0513-0544/images/page_521_image_13.jpg",
              "content": "u_p\n+\n-\nu_i\n-\nu_N\n+\n-\ngm1\n-\nC\ngm2\n+\n-\nu_o\n-"
            },
            {
